      en: ["Burundi's primary border post for imports from Tanzania.", "Key entry point for cargo from the port of Dar es Salaam.", "Host to large-scale customs and freight-forwarding facilities.", "Critical source of national revenue through customs duties.", "Major transit stop on the East African trade corridor.", "Features specialized services for long-haul truck drivers."],
